AERA: A Risk-Sensitive, Distributionally Robust, Governance-Constrained POMDP Architecture for Minimum-Sufficient Intervention in Amazon Ecosystem Restoration

Author / Principal Conceptor: Ouadi Maakoul

Research framing: Human–AI collaborative research

Status: Sixth theoretical research draft — measure-theoretic hardening, corrected risk composition, governance-invariant formalization, and operator-theoretic stability.

Draft notes to the reader. This sixth draft integrates a full theorem-hardening pass and a second referee review of v5. Material changes from v5:

