12.3 Functional integrity index

E(X_t) = w^T \tilde{X}_t = w_S \frac{S_t}{S_{\text{ref}}} + w_W \frac{W_t}{W_{\text{ref}}} + w_B \frac{B_t}{B_{\text{ref}}} + w_C \frac{C_t}{C_{\text{ref}}} + w_F \frac{F_t}{F_{\text{ref}}},


