For paired metric $Z_m = E_{\text{AERA}}^{(m)} - E_{\text{fixed}}^{(m)}$:
\Lambda_m = \sum_{i=1}^m \log \frac{f(Z_i \mid \mu = \delta_j^*)}{f(Z_i \mid \mu = 0)}, \quad \mathbb{A} = \log\frac{1-\beta}{\alpha}, \quad \mathbb{B} = \log\frac{\beta}{1-\alpha}.

